{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awaken Infinity</strong> is a visual novel with top-down 2D segments. You wake up with no memory in a locked, futuristic room, and the only one you can talk to is an artificial intelligence. Will you uncover the truth?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/extras/5bbfd6a8aabaf3ad264f16a274ae4206.poster.avif?t=1757335984\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/extras/5bbfd6a8aabaf3ad264f16a274ae4206.webm?t=1757335984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/extras/5bbfd6a8aabaf3ad264f16a274ae4206.mp4?t=1757335984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is it?</strong><br>Awaken Infinity is a compact, story-driven experience that blends visual novel storytelling with a touch of top-down 2D exploration. It\u2019s designed to be completed in a single sitting\u2014focused and without filler. Illustrated scenes and dialogue drive the narrative, while short top-down 2D segments enhance the story without overshadowing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/extras/7dd1f7e3628ce98f4197a644f88cec20.poster.avif?t=1757335984\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/extras/7dd1f7e3628ce98f4197a644f88cec20.webm?t=1757335984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/extras/7dd1f7e3628ce98f4197a644f88cec20.mp4?t=1757335984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you\u2019ll do</strong><br>\u2022 Wake up with no memory and try to make sense of your situation in a sterile, futuristic environment.<br>\u2022 Make choices that influence dialogue, unlock optional lines, and reveal short extra scenes.<br>\u2022 Explore in short top-down 2D segments to examine objects, trigger events, and uncover clues that deepen the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3168400?t=1757335984","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3168400?t=1757335984","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/49e3048cc6fcc202529445cecd01c0d24cf62b5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757335984","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/49e3048cc6fcc202529445cecd01c0d24cf62b5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757335984","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awaken Infinity</strong> is a visual novel with top-down 2D segments. You wake up with no memory in a locked, futuristic room, and the only one you can talk to is an artificial intelligence. Will you uncover the truth?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/extras/5bbfd6a8aabaf3ad264f16a274ae4206.poster.avif?t=1757335984\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/extras/5bbfd6a8aabaf3ad264f16a274ae4206.webm?t=1757335984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/extras/5bbfd6a8aabaf3ad264f16a274ae4206.mp4?t=1757335984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is it?</strong><br>Awaken Infinity is a compact, story-driven experience that blends visual novel storytelling with a touch of top-down 2D exploration. It\u2019s designed to be completed in a single sitting\u2014focused and without filler. Illustrated scenes and dialogue drive the narrative, while short top-down 2D segments enhance the story without overshadowing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/extras/7dd1f7e3628ce98f4197a644f88cec20.poster.avif?t=1757335984\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/extras/7dd1f7e3628ce98f4197a644f88cec20.webm?t=1757335984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/extras/7dd1f7e3628ce98f4197a644f88cec20.mp4?t=1757335984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you\u2019ll do</strong><br>\u2022 Wake up with no memory and try to make sense of your situation in a sterile, futuristic environment.<br>\u2022 Make choices that influence dialogue, unlock optional lines, and reveal short extra scenes.<br>\u2022 Explore in short top-down 2D segments to examine objects, trigger events, and uncover clues that deepen the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Launch Solutions"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168400/header.jpg?t=1757335984","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257051325,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257051325/movie480.mp4?t=1754049838","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257051325/